    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Naas present 11 Dun na Riogh Walk – a most impressive extended detached home standing at the end of a quiet cul de sac. This incredible home extends to a spacious 201 square metres and boasts naturally light-filled interiors presented in excellent condition. There is a state-of-the-art kitchen which overlooks the south-facing courtyard garden to the rear. A downstairs bedroom with en-suite has been added, creating many extra possibilities for the discerning purchaser.\r\n\r\nDun na Riogh Walk is situated within 2 km of the main street of Naas. All amenities, including shops, shopping centres, schools (primary and secondary), pubs, restaurants, parks, and playgrounds, are close by. The Sallins and Naas train station is just 2 km away, with national bus services also available. The nearby N7/M7 road network provides quick and convenient access to the M50.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hallway, lounge, dining area, kitchen area, laundry room (formerly a study), family room, utility room, five bedrooms (three en-suite), bathroom and guest wc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\n1.88m x 5.06m (6' 2\" x 16' 7\")\r\nTiled floor. Area of understairs storage. Decorative coving. Smoke alarm.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.98m x 5.02m (13' 1\" x 16' 6\")\r\nTiled floor. Feature cast-iron fireplace with inset gas fire. Tv point. Wall lights. Bay window. Recess lighting. Double doors with glazed insets leading to Dining Area.\r\n\r\nDining Area\r\n3.85m x 4.18m (12' 8\" x 13' 9\")\r\nTiled floor. Feature dining lighting. Skylight. French doors to rear.\r\n\r\nKitchen Area\r\n6.46m x 4.50m (21' 2\" x 14' 9\")\r\nHigh specification wall and base fitted units with display units and wine rack. Pantry press. Large area of worktop space. Integrated Zanussi dishwasher. Integrated professional Zanussi gas hob with chrome extractor. Zanussi electric oven. Tiled floor and splashback. Recess lighting.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\n1.38m x 1.97m (4' 6\" x 6' 6\")\r\nFully tiled with white contemporary wc and wash hand basin. Recess lighting.\r\n\r\nFamily Room\r\n3.93m x 3.88m (12' 11\" x 12' 9\")\r\nTiled floor. Recess lighting. Skylight. Tv point. French doors leading to rear courtyard/garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.57m x 5.59m (11' 9\" x 18' 4\")\r\nWall to wall fitted wardrobes and vanity unit. Tiled flooring. Tv point. Recess lighting. Skylight. French doors leading to courtyard/rear garden.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n1.98m x 2.49m (6' 6\" x 8' 2\")\r\nFully tiled with white wc, wall mounted wash hand basin and wetroom Triton safeguard electric shower. Skylight.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n1.43m x 2.25m (4' 8\" x 7' 5\")\r\nFitted wall units. Plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nLaundry Room (formerly Study)\r\n2.41m x 4.87m (7' 11\" x 16' 0\")\r\nTo front. Base fitted units. Stainless steel sink unit. Plumbed for washing machine. Spotlights. Decorative coving. Tiled floor. Bay window.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.42m x 4.67m (11' 3\" x 15' 4\")\r\nFitted wardrobe. Laminate flooring. Spotlights.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n0.89m x 2.65m (2' 11\" x 8' 8\")\r\nWhite wc and wash hand basin and tiled splashback. Tiled triton t90xt electric shower with screen. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.96m x 4.22m (13' 0\" x 13' 10\")\r\nTo front. Laminate flooring. Wall to wall fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n0.89m x 2.22m (2' 11\" x 7' 3\")\r\nWhite wc and wash hand basin with tiled splashback and storage. Tiled Triton Novelle shower with screen. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n2.92m x 3.93m (9' 7\" x 12' 11\")\r\nTo rear. Laminate flooring. Double fitted wardrobes. Spotlights.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5\r\n3.34m x 2.61m (10' 11\" x 8' 7\")\r\nLaminate flooring. Fitted wardrobe and vanity unit. Spotlights.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.76m x 2.00m (5' 9\" x 6' 7\")\r\nWhite wc, wash hand basin and bath. Tiled floor. Generous wall tiles. Novelle electric shower.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nFront: Driveway with space for numerous cars. Steel shed. Well maintained lawn. Outside light. Access on both sides to rear.\r\nRear: Very private south facing courtyard garden with granite patio area. Raised flowerbed. Outside lighting. Outside tap."
